rn techwear style that incorporates elements of traditional kimono design. I’d like it to have a similar vibe to the design shown in the image. You don't have to follow exactly.\n==Includes a sleeveless black tight inner layer and a low-waist design. This time I hope to have both sides of the waist exposed. \n\n药师: \nFeatures:\n==With a white choker, the overall style leans towards a blend of Japanese and Western fashion(和洋折衷). \n==There needs to be a small backpack. The hairstyle should still be long hair, and you can change it as you like.\n \nThe expression variations can be kept the same as last time! One standard facial expression + 5 additional facial expressions. If possible, you can redraw and design based on the picture from last time.\n\nIf the price does not match the scope of work, please feel free to propose adjustments.\n \nI really like your design style! You can also have complete freedom to create as you wish!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1qg5i104uv0zNGTkuKvFLC9WxjApusAop", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@85NEO3/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3388004, "client_id": 547450, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/23ebe05f/uploads/origins/6eb837f3-eaa2-4dd5-804f-f9f02c57145e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=586fa39525907571b8a0992644814724", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/23ebe05f/uploads/origins/6eb837f3-eaa2-4dd5-804f-f9f02c57145e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=586fa39525907571b8a0992644814724, https://si.imgix.net/23ebe05f/uploads/origins/6eb837f3-eaa2-4dd5-804f-f9f02c57145e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb8cee6c2c0cf974c7fc34d87a383986 2x, https://si.imgix.net/23ebe05f/uploads/origins/6eb837f3-eaa2-4dd5-804f-f9f02c57145e?bg